Fixed per-row queries in list views whose name/link columns resolve a parent object per row: component template tables now join in the parent device type/module type read by `get_absolute_url()`, module bay tables join in `installed_module` (read by both the tree link and the row action buttons), the Device table prefetches `parent_bay__device` when the Parent Device column is visible, and the Virtual Machine detail table prefetches the primary IPv4/IPv6 addresses when the IP Address column is visible.
